9. Keys
  Identity ≠ Management
  Choose join method based on ownership + environment
  Autopilot is the gold standard for new devices
  BYOD requires careful policy alignment
  Hybrid Join supports legacy dependencies
  Entra ID record does not mean Intune-managed

